v2.0
- Reflects changes in the software solution offered in a single node configuration.

v1.0.3.1
- Updates python-ks.yaml

v1.0.3
- Adds high level wrapper Full_TPCx-AI_Benchmarkrun.sh to run TPCx-AI_Benchmarkrun.sh immediately after TPCx-AI_Validation.sh
- Adds support for Spark3
- Adds support for Horovod v0.20+
- Normalize naming of training model output directory
- Sets prediction outputs to output directory (previously predictions were stored in the model directory)
- Enables verbosity in setenv.sh 
- Minor adjustments to metric computation and standardizes rounding of metric computation
- optional sleep-between-jobs parameter added for Spark UC2 and UC9
- Updates Conda environment definition files for python-venv and python-venv-ks
- Enables XGBoost Scala tracker usage (previously only the python tracker could be used)
- Updates README.md 


v1.0.2
- Adds the CHECK_INTEGRITY phase to the benchmark run script.
- VERIFICATION phase is integrated in the SCORING phase
- Reports number of files changed but allows the benchmark run to continue
- Removes dependency on pycryptodome
- Sets output directory for redundancy report to the logs/ directory

v1.0.1
- Upgrades PDGF to a newer version
- Creates two virtual environments for python execution
